data: {"id": "dbd2beb655d34410-thinking-parallel_evidence-1132", "run_id": "dbd2beb655d34410", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有工具结果分析：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 身份确认**：`aiops-case-v12/workload` 存在，属于 `aiops.lab/case-id=v12`\n2. **生命周期状态矛盾**：\n   - `kubectl_get_yaml` 返回 `phase: Running`，无 `deletionTimestamp`，无 `finalizers`\n   - `kubectl_describe` 返回 `status: Terminating`，有 `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-14T06:32:25Z`，`terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 3900s`\n   - `containerStatuses`: `app` 容器 `ready=True`，`restarts=0`\n   - 事件：`Normal Killing 48s kubelet Stopping container app`\n3. **节点状态**：`node2` 为 `Ready`，无 `Taints`，但 kubelet lea", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789363717283, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

